<p>There shall be no hate-sowing bitterness this time: A review of the concept follows.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Initial impressions: this seems like a clasic &quot;haunted car&quot; story, what will make it stand out from others of the type?</p>
<p>The narrative seems based and solid: proceeding along this line will make the story easy to manage and readily digestible in my opinion: however, I advise caution about making it too-high in Keter class, it needs further work to explain how they've managed to 'contain' it at-all.</p>
<p>Regarding the hook: how do you intend to convey that as &quot;a hook&quot;? Addressing this element will be key to your success. Furthermore, why is the man in the suit and hat relevant? More details would be useful here.</p>
<p>Notes: I will not forget, and I will not forgive: that kind of overly-negative review fosters a culture of hostility towards new talent and rejection of new ideas: I dislike such behavior, strongly. Please keep in touch, I will await updates avidly.</p>
</div>
